        ::= { zxAnPonRmOnuOamObjects 5 }

    zxAnPonRmOnuVoipCalleeTestEntry OBJECT-TYPE
        SYNTAX      ZxAnPonRmOnuVoipCalleeTestEntry
        MAX-ACCESS  not-accessible
        STATUS      current
        DESCRIPTION
            "An entry in the zxAnPonRmOnuVoipCalleeTestTable."
        INDEX       { ifIndex, zxAnPonOnuIndex, zxAnPonRmOnuIfIndex}
