            G.988 9.7.6 VDSL2 line configuration extensions."
        DEFVAL { 0 }
        ::= { zxAnPonRmXdslUpboPrfEntry 17 }   
        
    zxAnPonRmXdslUpboU5KLRef OBJECT-TYPE
        SYNTAX      Integer32 (0|18..635)
        UNITS       "0.1 dB"
