    zxAnPonRmXdsl2LH15MInterval  OBJECT-TYPE
        SYNTAX      Integer32(1..96)
        MAX-ACCESS  not-accessible
        STATUS      current
        DESCRIPTION
            "The interval number.
             Interval 1 is the the most recent previous interval and interval 96
