             history data."
        ::= { zxAnPonRmXdsl2PMChannelH15MEntry 4 }        

    zxAnPonRmXdsl2ChH15MUncorrBlks  OBJECT-TYPE
        SYNTAX      Counter32               
        MAX-ACCESS  read-only
        STATUS      current
        DESCRIPTION
            "The total number of blocks received with uncorrectable 
             errors on this channel during this interval."
        REFERENCE
            "G.988 9.7.23 xDSL xTU-C channel performance monitoring
             history data
             G.988 9.7.24 xDSL xTU-R channel performance monitoring
             history data."    
        ::= { zxAnPonRmXdsl2PMChannelH15MEntry 5 }  
        
    zxAnPonRmXdsl2ChH15MTxBlks  OBJECT-TYPE
        SYNTAX      Counter32              
        MAX-ACCESS  read-only
        STATUS      current
        DESCRIPTION
            "The total number of blocks transmitted on this channel
             during this interval."
        REFERENCE
            "G.988 9.7.23 xDSL xTU-C channel performance monitoring
             history data
             G.988 9.7.24 xDSL xTU-R channel performance monitoring
             history data."
        ::= { zxAnPonRmXdsl2PMChannelH15MEntry 6 }           
        
    zxAnPonRmXdsl2ChH15MRxBlks  OBJECT-TYPE
        SYNTAX      Counter32             
        MAX-ACCESS  read-only
        STATUS      current
        DESCRIPTION
            "The total number of blocks received on this channel
             during this interval."
        REFERENCE
            "G.988 9.7.23 xDSL xTU-C channel performance monitoring
             history data
             G.988 9.7.24 xDSL xTU-R channel performance monitoring
             history data."
        ::= { zxAnPonRmXdsl2PMChannelH15MEntry 7 }          
        
    zxAnPonRmXdsl2ChH15MCodeViolates  OBJECT-TYPE
        SYNTAX      Counter32              
