    zxAnPonRmGfastLnStatusTable  OBJECT-TYPE
        SYNTAX      SEQUENCE OF ZxAnPonRmGfastLnStatusEntry
        MAX-ACCESS  not-accessible
        STATUS      current
        DESCRIPTION
            "The G.fast line status table."            
